{"skill":{"slug":"eastmoney-select-stock","displayName":"eastmoney skills"},"version":{"version":"1.0.4","createdAt":1773799270383,"changelog":"- 修正环境变量说明：明确API Key应通过环境变量 MX_APIKEY 设置，统一命名与描述。\n- 细化环境变量检查说明：将“本地api是否存在”调整为“本地该环境变量是否存在”并优化相关说明表述。\n- 文档部分内容小幅调整，使叙述更准确清晰，无实际功能变化。\n- 移除了部分提及 EASTMONEY_APIKEY 的表述，统一为 MX_APIKEY。","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"mx_select_stock.py","size":9749,"sha256":"fbad0177dab13ebe7442793d39d36ac52c4194f3e52495e91d5ce18a90cdcb71","contentType":"text/x-python"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":5691,"sha256":"e300a2476f49ddd083990b17de350f6d942d1457283011de542c95031688eab2","contentType":null},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2127,"sha256":"80cb30d49f39156f0f375edd4d887eba51b81eca4ffd5b6020c23b8c53689260","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789171504028,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"9307690550ca07155b0a68d6545b37379aeca75c2ccb561019a503f777d2bb63","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/9307690550ca07155b0a68d6545b37379aeca75c2ccb561019a503f777d2bb63","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780085977355},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":23,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":3,"checkedAt":1789171504028},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill coherently provides stock-screening results through a disclosed external API, with privacy and CSV-opening cautions users should understand.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access to the hardcoded provider endpoint and local output file creation are proportionate to the skill's purpose; the fixed default output directory is disclosed and can be overridden by CLI.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No separate installer, dependency bootstrap, hidden package source, or install-time mutation was found in the inspected artifacts.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill discloses the external request and MX_APIKEY use, but users should avoid putting confidential trading strategies or personal information into queries because the query is transmitted to the provider.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill creates CSV, description, and raw JSON result files, but shows no service installation, scheduled task, memory poisoning, privilege escalation, or cross-session execution hook.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is natural-language stock screening using current market data, and the code implements that by sending the query to the documented 东方财富 API and saving returned results.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable sending stock-screening queries and the MX_APIKEY credential to the documented 东方财富 endpoint. Do not include sensitive personal or proprietary strategy details in queries, and open generated CSV files with spreadsheet formula protections enabled or inspect them as plain text first.","findings":"[E1] expected: The outbound POST is real, but it is the core disclosed mechanism for live stock screening rather than hidden exfiltration.\n[SQP-2] expected: The API key and user query are sent to the provider without a separate confirmation step; this is expected for the workflow, but users should treat queries as shared with the external API.\n[T09] unexpected: The CSV formula-injection warning is a valid output-hardening concern: remote response values are written to CSV without neutralizing spreadsheet formula prefixes, so users should be cautious opening generated CSV files in spreadsheet apps.","agenticRiskFi